{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"撒迦利亚书","commonName":"撒迦利亚书","title":"撒迦利亚书","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"feb08b9a448a6d8849ead791b305b99aa373ff61cc0aae0e1cd0cc54993789dc","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":11,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["暴君的没落"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"黎巴嫩哪，开开你的门，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任火烧灭你的香柏树。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"松树啊，应当哀号；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为香柏树倾倒，佳美的树毁坏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴珊的橡树啊，应当哀号，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为茂盛的树林已经倒了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"听啊，有牧人哀号的声音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他们荣华的草场毁坏了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有少壮狮子咆哮的声音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因约旦河旁的丛林荒废了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["两个牧人"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和华—我的 神如此说：「你—撒迦利亚要牧养这将宰的群羊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["买他们的宰了他们，以自己为无罪；卖他们的说：『耶和华是应当称颂的，因我成为富足。』牧养他们的并不怜恤他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和华说：『我不再怜恤这地的居民，必将这民交给各人的邻舍和他们王的手中。他们必毁灭这地，我也不救这民脱离他们的手。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["于是，我牧养这将宰的群羊，就是群中最困苦的羊。我拿着两根杖，一根我称为「荣美」，一根我称为「联索」。这样，我牧养了群羊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["一月之内，我除灭三个牧人，因为我的心厌烦他们；他们的心也憎嫌我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我就说：「我不牧养你们。要死的，由他死；要丧亡的，由他丧亡；余剩的，由他们彼此相食。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我折断那称为「荣美」的杖，表明我废弃与万民所立的约。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["当日就废弃了。这样，那些仰望我的困苦羊就知道所说的是耶和华的话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我对他们说：「你们若以为美，就给我工价。不然，就罢了！」于是他们给了三十块钱作为我的工价。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["耶和华吩咐我说：「要把众人所估定美好的价值丢给窑户。」我便将这三十块钱，在耶和华的殿中丢给窑户了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我又折断称为「联索」的那根杖，表明我废弃犹大与以色列弟兄的情谊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["耶和华又吩咐我说：「你再取愚昧牧人所用的器具，"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["因我要在这地兴起一个牧人。他不看顾丧亡的，不寻找分散的，不医治受伤的，也不牧养强壮的；却要吃肥羊的肉，撕裂它的蹄子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"无用的牧人丢弃羊群有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刀必临到他的膀臂和右眼上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的膀臂必全然枯干；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的右眼也必昏暗失明。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/11.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/12.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}